    faq_q_projekt_erstellen: 'How do I create a new project?',
    faq_a_projekt_erstellen: 'Go to the \'Projects\' tab and tap \'+ New\'. Enter a name, description, and prefix for automatic numbering. Choose a color for visual distinction.',
    faq_q_aufnahme_starten: 'How do I start a recording?',
    faq_a_aufnahme_starten: 'Switch to the \'Recording\' tab. First select a project (or \'Continue without project\') and tap the red record button. You can take photos at any time during recording.',
    faq_q_pdf_export: 'How do I export a protocol as PDF?',
    faq_a_pdf_export: 'Open a protocol in the detail view and tap the PDF icon in the top right. The PDF is generated with your company logo, all photos, and to-dos, and can be shared directly.',
    faq_q_fotos_aufnahme: 'Can I take photos during recording?',
    faq_a_fotos_aufnahme: 'Yes! During audio recording, you can take photos at any time that are automatically assigned to the protocol. Just tap the camera button.',
    faq_q_markierungen: 'How do I set markers during recording?',
    faq_a_markierungen: 'During an active recording, you can tap the \'Marker\' button or say the word \'Marker\'. The protocol will then be divided into sections.',
    faq_q_firmenlogo: 'How do I change my company logo in the PDF?',
    faq_a_firmenlogo: 'Go to Settings → PDF Branding. There you can upload your logo, customize headers and footers, and configure the PDF colors.',
    faq_q_bearbeiten: 'Can I edit protocols afterwards?',
    faq_a_bearbeiten: 'Yes! Open the protocol and tap \'Edit\'. You can freely adjust the text, add or remove to-dos, and add photos.',
    faq_q_zeiterfassung: 'How does time tracking work?',
    faq_a_zeiterfassung: 'Go to a project and open time tracking. Start the timer at the beginning of work and stop it at the end. Times are saved per project and day.',
    faq_q_offline: 'My recording was not saved – what to do?',
    faq_a_offline: 'Check under Protocols if the recording is in the offline queue (orange icon). If not, check your device storage. If problems persist, restart the app.',
    onboarding_desc_1: 'Simply dictate your protocol and simultaneously photograph damages, defects, or details. Audio + Photo – everything in one recording.',
    onboarding_desc_2: 'Send the finished protocol as a professional PDF directly via WhatsApp, email, or the share dialog – with logo and photos.',
    onboarding_desc_3: 'Organize protocols in projects, choose from 6+ templates (site report, defect list...) or create your own. Everything available offline.',
    onboarding_desc_4: 'Automatic location detection, calendar integration, translation into 8 languages, push reminders for tasks, and cloud sync.',
