    beispiel_transkript: 'Today we inspected the construction site at 35 Mill Street. The shell construction is complete. The ground floor still needs electrical installation. The windows on the second floor are damaged and need to be replaced. Site manager Mr. Miller was present. Next appointment is Friday at 10 AM.',
    vorlage_loeschen_frage: 'Really delete template "{name}"?',
