    sprich_kapitelname: 'Say the chapter name or type it in',
    prompt_abnahmeprotokoll: 'Create a formal acceptance protocol with: 1. Object/construction project, 2. Date and participants, 3. Subject of acceptance, 4. Identified defects (numbered with deadline), 5. Agreements, 6. Result (accepted/not accepted/with reservations), 7. Signature field.',
    prompt_wartungsprotokoll: 'Create a maintenance protocol with: 1. System/device, 2. Location, 3. Date and technician, 4. Work performed (checklist), 5. Identified defects, 6. Recommended measures, 7. Next maintenance date.',
    prompt_brandschutzbegehung: 'Create a fire safety inspection protocol with: 1. Object and date, 2. Participants, 3. Inspected areas, 4. Checklist (escape route clear, fire extinguisher present, fire doors functional, etc.), 5. Identified defects with priority, 6. Measures and deadlines.',
    prompt_projektstatusbericht: 'Create a project status report with: 1. Project title and reporting period, 2. Overall status (traffic light), 3. Completed tasks, 4. Ongoing tasks, 5. Risks and problems, 6. Next steps, 7. Decision needs.',
    prompt_kundengespraech: 'Create a structured summary of the client meeting with: 1. Client and contact person, 2. Date and duration, 3. Topics discussed, 4. Client requirements, 5. Agreed next steps, 6. Open items, 7. Follow-up appointment.',
    prompt_schulungsprotokoll: 'Create a training protocol with: 1. Training topic, 2. Date, location, and duration, 3. Trainer, 4. Participant list, 5. Content covered (bullet points), 6. Practical exercises, 7. Open questions, 8. Attendance confirmation.',
    prompt_schadensgutachten: 'Create a damage assessment with: 1. Object and location, 2. Client, 3. Inspection date, 4. Damage description (detailed), 5. Cause of damage (if identifiable), 6. Extent and evaluation, 7. Recommended remediation measures, 8. Estimated costs.',
    tpl_energieausweis: 'Energy Certificate Inspection',
    tpl_energieausweis_desc: 'Data collection for energy assessment',
    prompt_energieausweis: 'Create an inspection protocol for energy assessment with: 1. Building data (year built, area, floors), 2. Building envelope (walls, roof, windows, basement ceiling), 3. Heating system, 4. Hot water preparation, 5. Ventilation, 6. Identified energy weaknesses, 7. Modernization recommendations.',
    prompt_telefonnotiz: 'Create a phone memo with: 1. Date and time, 2. Conversation partner, 3. Subject, 4. Conversation content (summary), 5. Agreements/action items, 6. Follow-up/deadline.',
    prompt_tagesrapport: 'Create a daily report with: 1. Date and construction site, 2. Weather, 3. Workers (name, hours, activity), 4. Equipment used, 5. Materials consumed, 6. Work performed, 7. Special incidents, 8. Work status.',
