    legal_ds_zweck_registrierung: 'Account registration, authentication and provision of the desired app functions: final B2B/B2C model and specific legal basis – ',
    legal_ds_zweck_verwaltung: 'Project, protocol, task and defect management: contract or documented legitimate interest, depending on the controller role and customer contract',
    legal_ds_zweck_optionale: 'Optional AI, location, cloud and third-party functions: only after purpose-related activation and transparent information; the specific legal basis must be documented per function',
    legal_ds_zweck_sicherheit: 'Security, abuse prevention and necessary logging: legitimate interest or legal obligation, following a documented balancing of interests',
    legal_ds_zweck_aufbewahrung: 'Legal retention and legal defense: only to the extent specifically required',
    legal_ds_4_lokale: '4. Local and Server-Side Processing',
    legal_ds_lokale_text: 'BuildKI stores part of the projects, settings, media references and consent information locally on the device. With account, cloud, synchronization, upload, email, AI, payment, Dropbox, Matterport, weather or push functions, data is additionally transmitted to BuildKI servers or external providers. Uninstalling therefore does not automatically delete all data.',
